      <div type="clause" n="81">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Abt">Abt</ref> 81</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hio bearn ne gebyreþ, fæderingmagas fioh agan ⁊ morgengyfe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If she does not bear a child, her paternal kin should obtain [her] property and the morning-gift.</ab>
